From 38d11c81ddb743b1c684a61e90aa62351ce6d4a8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 15:30:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ci(release): R3 release workflow that matches the fleet

Workflow-only commit (the cloud GitHub App cannot push workflow files).
The matrix is now exactly linux-x86_64 (ubuntu-24.04) and darwin-arm64
(macos-14). The build:
- installs opus;
- stages the committed desktop dist as build-linux does, only when
  DESKTOP_REPO_TOKEN exists, and never sets PHILOTIC_DESKTOP_DIR;
- bakes in PHILOTIC_BUILD_SHA;
- builds the release/packages.toml set.

Each platform ships philotic-<tag>-<os>-<arch>.tar.gz (bin/*,
SHA256SUMS, manifest.json) and a standalone .manifest.json. The release
job adds an outer SHA256SUMS, build-provenance attestations
(attest-build-provenance@v1) and a GitHub release, marked prerelease for
-rc/-beta/-alpha tags. The tap job writes Formula/philotic-web.rb, and
skips with a notice when TAP_GITHUB_TOKEN is missing.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LRHkSGZVkQKmmHGiv24BGB
